ClrErr

© Init Vars
Local tp,dg,lst,dgl,typ
Local dgt, digs
0→digs:0→tp:0→dg:{}→lst
{"Numeric","Digicode","Alpha-Num","Sp-αNum"}→typ

© Display Box & Menu
© Box 1
