{"  5 Digs","  6 Digs"}→lst
Else
{"  8 Digs"," 10 Digs"," 12 Digs"," 14 Digs"," 16 Digs"}→lst
EndIf

© Box 2
Dialog
Title "🔓 PwDGeN 🔓"
Text ""
Text "Choose Digits :"
DropDown "Digs :",lst,dg
Text ""
EndDlog
If ok=0:Goto start

© keygen condition
1→digs
expr(lst[dg])→dgt

